What this repository does NOT contain
-------------------------------------
- No Pioneer firmware, no part of it, and no Pioneer program code.
- No encryption keys.
The builder page reads Pioneer's firmware and the update key from files the user downloads from Pioneer/AlphaTheta
and processes them only on the user's own computer. Its output contains Pioneer's firmware and is for the user's
own device only.

The library (device/libxdjmod) checks a few short byte sequences of Pioneer's program before it changes anything
in memory, so that it acts only on the exact program version it was made for.

